# Film 4 of still.fail in use on the iPhone Duo simulator, in Chinese: asked for a change, the agent starts its dev
# server on the station, and its page is opened on the phone (story scripts/story/iduo-service-zh.json,
# FILM_LANG=zh FILM_STORY=iduo-service-zh).
timeout 45000
until 发消息
# (the film once the app is on the screen as it stays: its first frames, as it starts, are none of the story)
wait 1200
at start
wait 1500
# (the list open over the chat as the outer screen lights: the chat tapped where it shows at the right, the list goes)
at tap=chat
tapxy 430 330
wait 1500
at unfold
log UNFOLD
wait 4500
at tap=发消息
tap 发消息
wait 600
at keys
pinyin dingjiaye|定价页
wait 160
pinyin jiashang|加上
wait 160
pinyin nianfu|年付
wait 160
pinyin jiage|价格
wait 160
wait 600
at tap=send
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 400
at kb-down
# (the keyboard left up as one does: tapping the answer's card takes the page over, the keyboard down with it)
wait 500
at working
until 打开定价页
at answer
wait 2200
at open
tap 打开定价页
wait 2500
at page
wait 3500
# (seen, back to the chat to say ship it)
at tap=back
tap icon:close
wait 1200
at tap=发消息2
tap 发消息
wait 600
at keys2
pinyin shangxian|上线
wait 160
pinyin ba|吧
wait 160
wait 600
at tap=send2
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 400
until 4b7e2d1
at merged
wait 3200
at end
exit
